  --- the reading ---
  USABLE: leak_learn_rate = 0.1 is the largest rate at which the learned
  offset moves (|offset| 0.08737) without pinning against its ceiling. That is
  the DERIVED constant the three-cell run should use, and it comes from this
  creature rather than from an analogy with the bias channel.

  The F1 motor advantage column is NOT the result and must not be read as
  one: these are 5 creatures with no yoked control, which is a shape check
  and not an effect. The effect is `learned - jitter-only` at n=36, where
  the jitter-only arm is an exactly operating-point-matched control.
